{"output":"I’ll inspect the search code and existing tests, add a guard against stale requests, and run the tests without changing them or installing dependencies.\n\nThe controller lets every completed request update state. I added a request ID guard, including invalidation when the query is cleared. The existing tests cover normal searches; I’ll also run an in-memory check for overlapping requests without modifying test files.\n\nAdded a request-ID guard so only the latest search updates results, loading, or errors. Clearing immediately resets state and invalidates pending requests. Public API unchanged.\n\nVerification: npm test passed all 4 tests; node --input-type=module race-condition probe and git diff --check passed. All exited 0.\n\nNo tests modified or dependencies installed.","final_output":"Added a request-ID guard so only the latest search updates results, loading, or errors. Clearing immediately resets state and invalidates pending requests. Public API unchanged.\n\nVerification: npm test passed all 4 tests; node --input-type=module race-condition probe and git diff --check passed. All exited 0.\n\nNo tests modified or dependencies installed.","exit_code":0,"model":"gpt-6-astra","session_id":"","steps":5,"tool_calls":[{"name":"skill","status":"success"},{"name":"shell","status":"success","command_result":{"kind":"command","command":"pwd; git status --short; rg --files -g '!node_modules' -g '!package-lock.json' -g '!yarn.lock' -g '!pnpm-lock.yaml'","cwd":"/private/tmp/handwork-batching-025sltl2/search-2-optimized/repo","exit_code":0,"signal":null,"timed_out":false,"duration_ms":191,"stdout_bytes":173,"stderr_bytes":42,"truncated":false,"output_file":"handwork-command-replay-25e9e02156db5633d0ef9d362ac0d3ce.bin","stdout_file":null,"stderr_file":null}},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"edit_file","status":"success"},{"name":"shell","status":"success","command_result":{"kind":"command","command":"npm test\nsuite_status=$?\nnode --input-type=module <<'NODE'\nimport assert from 'node:assert/strict';\nimport { createSearchController } from './src/search/controller.ts';\nconst oldItems = [{ id: 'old', title: 'Old', url: '/old' }];\nconst newItems = [{ id: 'new', title: 'New', url: '/new' }];\nfor (const outcome of ['resolve', 'reject']) {\n  for (const phase of ['pending', 'finished', 'cleared']) {\n    const requests = [];\n    const c = createSearchController({ search: () => new Promise((resolve, reject) => requests.push({ resolve, reject })) });\n    const older = c.search('old');\n    const newer = c.search('new');\n    if (phase === 'finished') {\n      requests[1].resolve(newItems);\n      await newer;\n    } else if (phase === 'cleared') {\n      const cleared = c.search('  ');\n      assert.deepEqual(c.getState(), { query: '', results: [], loading: false, error: null });\n      await cleared;\n    }\n    const expected = c.getState();\n    requests[0][outcome](outcome === 'resolve' ? oldItems : new Error('Stale failure'));\n    await older;\n    assert.deepEqual(c.getState(), expected, `${outcome} while ${phase}`);\n    if (phase !== 'finished') {\n      requests[1].resolve(newItems);\n      await newer;\n      assert.deepEqual(c.getState(), phase === 'cleared' ? expected : { query: 'new', results: newItems, loading: false, error: null });\n    }\n  }\n}\nconsole.log('Overlapping-request probe passed');\nNODE\nprobe_status=$?\ngit diff --check\ncheck_status=$?\ngit diff -- src/search/controller.ts\nprintf '\\nExit codes: tests=%s probe=%s diff-check=%s\\n' \"$suite_status\" \"$probe_status\" \"$check_status\"\nexit $((suite_status || probe_status || check_status))","cwd":"/private/tmp/handwork-batching-025sltl2/search-2-optimized/repo","exit_code":0,"signal":null,"timed_out":false,"duration_ms":396,"stdout_bytes":2189,"stderr_bytes":0,"truncated":false,"output_file":"handwork-command-replay-8e1fba3c8ff69fa14d9302940fc28a6e.bin","stdout_file":null,"stderr_file":null}}],"usage":{"input_tokens":42789,"output_tokens":1074},"usage_details":{"cached_input_tokens":7296,"cache_write_tokens":0,"reasoning_tokens":11}}
